{"3883670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Silly little Adventure", "steam_appid": 3883670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash-land on an abandoned vacation island in A Silly little Adventure, a couch co-op 3D platformer where every upgrade unlocks new ways to roam as you work your way back to your spaceship.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO HEADS ARE BETTER THAN ONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend in couch co-op to traverse challenging 3D platforming spaces built around teamwork. The path home cannot be taken alone — only together can you make it back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN ISLAND WITH A PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a once-beloved vacation paradise built by a group of friends who turned their crash landing into a home. Along the way, discover journal entries left behind that reveal fragments of their time on the island.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Couch Co-Op Adventure</strong> – Play locally or via Remote Play Together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team-Based Platforming</strong> – Built around coordination, timing, and working together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement-Driven Upgrades</strong> – Gain new movement abilities that open up previously unreachable areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-Focused Island</strong> – Discover hidden paths, secrets, and optional routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectathon Progression</strong> – Gather upgrades and unlock new ways to explore the island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> – Personalize your character for the journey</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash-land on an abandoned vacation island in A Silly little Adventure, a couch co-op 3D platf